1
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:09,926
‎His Majesty the King!

2
00:01:27,629 --> 00:01:30,840
‎I shall worry for you no longer.

3
00:01:32,008 --> 00:01:32,926
‎Instead,

4
00:01:33,635 --> 00:01:34,761
‎from this day on,

5
00:01:35,261 --> 00:01:37,472
‎I shall simply pray for your future.

6
00:01:39,349 --> 00:01:41,726
‎And I shall entrust

7
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:46,147
‎those wishes to you
‎with these flower petals.

8
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:23,119
‎At the initial examination,

9
00:03:23,202 --> 00:03:27,332
‎I asked why the southern sacred herb
‎may serve as a virtue of a loyal subject.

10
00:03:27,415 --> 00:03:29,334
‎And I found myself greatly impressed

11
00:03:29,417 --> 00:03:33,713
‎by the answer of the one
‎who interpreted ‎The Analects‎' teaching,

12
00:03:33,796 --> 00:03:35,757
‎"Be slow in speech, swift in action."

13
00:03:46,559 --> 00:03:49,395
‎This is that man's answer
‎from the recent palace examination.

14
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:52,023
‎"When a new branch grows from an old tree,

15
00:03:52,523 --> 00:03:55,151
‎what must it cast aside,
‎what must it preserve,

16
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:57,695
‎and toward what must it stretch forth?"

17
00:03:57,779 --> 00:04:01,908
‎Surely he knew this question reflected
‎the predicament in which I stand.

18
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:04,494
‎And yet,

19
00:04:05,453 --> 00:04:07,163
‎what answer did he give?

20
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,752
‎In a hall devoted to solemn scholarship,

21
00:04:12,835 --> 00:04:16,506
‎he dared criticize
‎the failure to pursue practical truth.

22
00:04:18,216 --> 00:04:20,301
‎No, Your Majesty. It was not--

23
00:04:20,385 --> 00:04:22,470
‎"Fearing to cut away the old branches

24
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:24,973
‎would instead rob the tree of its life."

25
00:04:25,056 --> 00:04:26,349
‎Is this not what you wrote?

26
00:04:28,351 --> 00:04:31,479
‎In such insolently plain prose, no less!

27
00:04:36,776 --> 00:04:38,069
‎This is only water.

28
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:40,154
‎Though it wets the white porcelain,

29
00:04:40,738 --> 00:04:42,740
‎it soon dries and leaves no trace.

30
00:04:44,575 --> 00:04:46,327
‎And this is ink.

31
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:49,330
‎It does not wash away so easily.

32
00:04:52,041 --> 00:04:53,501
‎It stains you.

33
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:57,463
‎Do you understand?

34
00:04:58,756 --> 00:05:02,510
‎I shall watch closely
‎whether what has been poured upon

35
00:05:02,593 --> 00:05:05,179
‎the white porcelain that is you
‎proves to be ink or water.

36
00:05:06,514 --> 00:05:07,515
‎Yes, Your Majesty.

37
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:22,071
‎Come with me.

38
00:05:32,498 --> 00:05:34,125
‎Chief Eunuch, can you guess

39
00:05:34,208 --> 00:05:37,587
‎why I spared a man
‎who dared write such frivolous prose

40
00:05:38,671 --> 00:05:40,298
‎at the solemn examination?

41
00:05:43,551 --> 00:05:47,305
‎He has an insolent manner
‎of voicing his thoughts,

42
00:05:48,139 --> 00:05:50,141
‎but he lacks the talent to deceive me.

43
00:05:52,185 --> 00:05:54,979
‎For one such as I,
‎whose whole life is bound to the palace,

44
00:05:55,688 --> 00:05:58,066
‎a man like him
‎will prove useful if kept close.

45
00:06:02,945 --> 00:06:04,989
‎He is not one I can simply turn away.

46
00:06:12,497 --> 00:06:17,418
‎THE SCANDAL

47
00:06:18,002 --> 00:06:20,713
‎Even if the girl can read and write,

48
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:23,007
‎the ‎Elementary Learning
‎may be a touch beyond her.

49
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:26,094
‎If she can read it,

50
00:06:26,177 --> 00:06:28,721
‎then she can surely learn it as well.

51
00:06:29,305 --> 00:06:31,224
‎Yes, that is true.

52
00:06:33,059 --> 00:06:35,937
‎Still, she has never
‎properly studied before,

53
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:38,564
‎so I fear it may not come easily to her.

54
00:06:38,648 --> 00:06:40,108
‎Even as a concubine,

55
00:06:40,191 --> 00:06:42,193
‎she is to become
‎a member of the Yoo family.

56
00:06:42,276 --> 00:06:44,612
‎We cannot treat such a matter carelessly.

57
00:06:46,197 --> 00:06:48,074
‎She must at least learn

58
00:06:48,157 --> 00:06:50,827
‎the proper decorum
‎and how to conduct herself.

59
00:06:51,327 --> 00:06:53,287
‎Only then will So-ok

60
00:06:53,371 --> 00:06:55,540
‎not be scorned wherever she goes.

61
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,958
‎You are right.

62
00:06:58,209 --> 00:07:00,378
‎We cannot have people whispering

63
00:07:01,003 --> 00:07:02,713
‎that I took in an ignorant concubine.

64
00:07:02,797 --> 00:07:03,631
‎Very well, then.

65
00:07:04,507 --> 00:07:06,926
‎Please leave this matter to me, my lord.

66
00:07:13,141 --> 00:07:14,767
‎It may seem harsh,

67
00:07:15,351 --> 00:07:17,895
‎but know that it is all for your own good.

68
00:07:19,188 --> 00:07:21,732
‎Study the Introduction
‎to Confucian Learning by copying it out

69
00:07:22,233 --> 00:07:23,192
‎a hundred times.

70
00:07:24,402 --> 00:07:25,445
‎A hundred times?

71
00:07:45,089 --> 00:07:46,257
‎Young Madam.

72
00:07:47,216 --> 00:07:49,260
‎Young Madam, are you asleep?

73
00:07:51,888 --> 00:07:52,889
‎"Young Madam"?

74
00:07:59,103 --> 00:08:00,188
‎A letter for you.

75
00:08:03,691 --> 00:08:04,567
‎A letter?

76
00:08:09,822 --> 00:08:12,575
‎I deeply regret
‎breaking the alarm clock earlier today.

77
00:08:13,743 --> 00:08:16,746
‎It weighs on me that
‎I damaged something so precious to you,

78
00:08:16,829 --> 00:08:18,206
‎though unintentional.

79
00:08:19,248 --> 00:08:21,459
‎I offer my sincerest apologies.

80
00:08:22,752 --> 00:08:24,879
‎I scarcely know
‎how I might repay this wrong.

81
00:08:26,088 --> 00:08:29,091
‎Oh, I am the youngest son of
‎the Left State Councilor across the way,

82
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,718
‎Kwon In-ho.

83
00:08:30,801 --> 00:08:31,677
‎"In-ho"?

84
00:08:33,596 --> 00:08:34,889
‎Then give me money for it.

85
00:09:31,362 --> 00:09:32,655
‎Whoa, whoa.

86
00:09:33,614 --> 00:09:35,616
‎All right. Down now.

87
00:10:07,356 --> 00:10:08,608
‎Catholic faith.

88
00:10:09,942 --> 00:10:13,487
‎In the name of the Father,
‎and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit.

89
00:10:14,530 --> 00:10:15,990
‎-Amen.
‎-Amen.

90
00:10:16,073 --> 00:10:18,451
‎I will go unto the altar of God.

91
00:10:18,534 --> 00:10:21,621
‎Our help is in the name of the Lord.

92
00:10:26,417 --> 00:10:29,003
‎The body of our Lord Jesus Christ.

93
00:10:55,196 --> 00:10:57,823
‎My cousin feared a palanquin

94
00:10:58,407 --> 00:11:01,035
‎stands out more at night.

95
00:11:02,578 --> 00:11:04,288
‎And so she bade me come fetch you,

96
00:11:04,372 --> 00:11:07,625
‎saying your journey home
‎would be far too dangerous.

97
00:11:10,753 --> 00:11:13,255
‎I know what sort of gatherings
‎are held in this house.

98
00:11:13,339 --> 00:11:14,340
‎That is why

99
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:17,093
‎she chose to send me.

100
00:11:33,109 --> 00:11:35,277
‎When I was a child,
‎around this time of year,

101
00:11:35,361 --> 00:11:39,240
‎my mother would always tuck
‎dried mugwort leaves into my hands.

102
00:11:40,241 --> 00:11:41,951
‎Once the weather turned warm,

103
00:11:42,034 --> 00:11:43,828
‎the mosquitoes would grow fierce.

104
00:11:46,497 --> 00:11:50,334
‎She feared her only son's face
‎would be covered in bites.

105
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:56,006
‎Here you go.

106
00:11:58,092 --> 00:12:00,302
‎Dried mugwort leaves.
‎Keep them in your hand as you go.

107
00:12:01,971 --> 00:12:04,765
‎If you were to return
‎with mosquito welts upon your face,

108
00:12:05,599 --> 00:12:07,435
‎would that not arouse suspicion at home?

109
00:12:08,018 --> 00:12:09,186
‎I shall be fine.

110
00:12:10,479 --> 00:12:12,481
‎No, you shall not.

111
00:12:14,733 --> 00:12:17,653
‎If suspicion falls upon you,
‎your whereabouts will be discovered.

112
00:12:17,736 --> 00:12:21,282
‎Then not only I,
‎but everyone gathered here tonight,

113
00:12:22,366 --> 00:12:23,742
‎shall come to harm.

114
00:12:24,326 --> 00:12:25,453
‎Now would that be fine?

115
00:12:27,163 --> 00:12:27,997
‎Would it?

116
00:12:35,504 --> 00:12:36,505
‎Here now.

117
00:12:45,473 --> 00:12:46,474
‎Madam.

118
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:49,894
‎The palanquin has just returned.

119
00:12:51,103 --> 00:12:54,690
‎The Left State Councilor's daughter-in-law
‎returned home safely, I trust?

120
00:12:54,773 --> 00:12:57,151
‎No, the palanquin returned empty.

121
00:12:57,234 --> 00:12:59,695
‎It turns out Lord Cho Won came
‎and sent it back ahead.

122
00:12:59,778 --> 00:13:01,030
‎What a reckless thing to do!

123
00:13:01,989 --> 00:13:03,407
‎Send the palanquin back at once.

124
00:13:06,827 --> 00:13:08,746
‎Have them wait at the entrance to Bukchon,

125
00:13:09,371 --> 00:13:12,166
‎and when she arrives,
‎they are to escort her home without fail.

126
00:13:17,505 --> 00:13:18,464
‎Gye-hwa.

127
00:13:18,547 --> 00:13:19,590
‎Yes, madam?

128
00:13:19,673 --> 00:13:21,842
‎If anyone were to catch sight of my cousin

129
00:13:21,926 --> 00:13:24,386
‎with the Left State Councilor's
‎widowed daughter-in-law,

130
00:13:25,137 --> 00:13:27,515
‎what would become
‎of this gossip-ridden Bukchon?

131
00:13:28,933 --> 00:13:29,892
‎Yes, madam.

132
00:13:32,353 --> 00:13:34,813
‎And the Left State Councilor and his wife?

133
00:13:34,897 --> 00:13:36,774
‎They have not yet returned, I trust?

134
00:13:36,857 --> 00:13:37,733
‎Yes, madam.

135
00:13:38,234 --> 00:13:39,235
‎Then hurry.

136
00:14:07,721 --> 00:14:08,556
‎Oh, yes.

137
00:14:09,473 --> 00:14:10,307
‎Well,

138
00:14:11,308 --> 00:14:13,435
‎the road is strewn with stones.

139
00:14:14,144 --> 00:14:17,314
‎Should you stumble,
‎I would not dare catch hold of you.

140
00:14:17,398 --> 00:14:18,399
‎So do take care

141
00:14:19,650 --> 00:14:21,360
‎and mind your step as you come.

142
00:14:51,807 --> 00:14:52,975
‎Please go on ahead.

143
00:14:53,934 --> 00:14:55,644
‎I shall rest a moment.

144
00:14:58,355 --> 00:14:59,189
‎Oh, dear.

145
00:14:59,899 --> 00:15:00,774
‎I was

146
00:15:01,692 --> 00:15:03,569
‎thinking only of my own pace, was I not?

147
00:15:04,528 --> 00:15:05,404
‎My apologies.

148
00:15:05,988 --> 00:15:07,281
‎Let us rest a while, then.

149
00:15:21,086 --> 00:15:21,921
‎Tell me.

150
00:15:23,756 --> 00:15:25,799
‎Why did you not take your own life?

151
00:15:28,052 --> 00:15:29,553
‎Had you ended it then,

152
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:33,432
‎you would already have been honored
‎as a virtuous woman.

153
00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:42,024
‎My mother-in-law was ill,

154
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:45,444
‎and there were too few hands at home.

155
00:15:47,029 --> 00:15:49,073
‎And other issues
‎that caused it to be delayed.

156
00:15:49,657 --> 00:15:52,868
‎But now that
‎my mother-in-law has recovered,

157
00:15:52,952 --> 00:15:54,870
‎I shall soon be able
‎to follow my husband…

158
00:15:57,998 --> 00:15:58,832
‎So…

159
00:16:00,584 --> 00:16:01,877
‎do you really mean to do it?

160
00:16:03,837 --> 00:16:05,631
‎Take your own life?

161
00:16:09,426 --> 00:16:10,761
‎You will not be able to.

162
00:16:12,179 --> 00:16:15,766
‎All the more so now that you've learned
‎the Lord's teachings, which cherish life.

163
00:16:19,353 --> 00:16:22,064
‎Do not be alarmed.

164
00:16:22,147 --> 00:16:24,274
‎I am not unfamiliar with those teachings.

165
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:28,612
‎I have always taken an interest
‎in all manner of learning,

166
00:16:28,696 --> 00:16:31,782
‎and I naturally came upon them
‎while studying Western learning.

167
00:16:33,909 --> 00:16:34,994
‎Whoa, whoa.

168
00:16:37,454 --> 00:16:38,330
‎My lord.

169
00:16:39,498 --> 00:16:42,084
‎Her Ladyship ordered
‎that we escort her back.

170
00:16:45,671 --> 00:16:46,505
‎Is that so?

171
00:16:53,846 --> 00:16:55,097
‎All right, up.

172
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:57,266
‎Go.

173
00:17:56,658 --> 00:17:59,745
‎Madam, the palanquin has returned safely.

174
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,546
‎-My lady!
‎-Whoa, whoa.

175
00:18:09,630 --> 00:18:10,464
‎My lady.

176
00:18:10,547 --> 00:18:11,590
‎Eun-sil.

177
00:18:12,382 --> 00:18:13,217
‎This way.

178
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,895
‎All right, down now.

179
00:19:06,395 --> 00:19:08,313
‎INTRODUCTION
‎TO ESSENTIAL CATHOLIC TEACHINGS

180
00:19:13,152 --> 00:19:16,029
‎"Thou shalt not kill."

181
00:19:19,783 --> 00:19:22,619
‎"Thou shalt not kill."

182
00:23:19,815 --> 00:23:20,649
‎Madam.

183
00:23:22,234 --> 00:23:25,320
‎If you cannot sleep,
‎shall I bring you some tea?

184
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,907
‎I'm sorry to trouble you.

185
00:23:29,741 --> 00:23:32,244
‎I am quite all right, so you may go back.

186
00:23:49,427 --> 00:23:53,390
‎How could Her Ladyship make me
‎copy this out a hundred times?

187
00:23:55,142 --> 00:23:56,977
‎It was that young master
‎who caused trouble,

188
00:23:58,436 --> 00:24:00,021
‎so why is this falling on me?

189
00:24:12,284 --> 00:24:13,410
‎Goodness.

190
00:24:23,253 --> 00:24:26,173
‎YOUR APOLOGY…

191
00:24:57,537 --> 00:24:58,997
‎Your apology

192
00:24:59,497 --> 00:25:01,583
‎made me both grateful and ashamed.

193
00:25:02,667 --> 00:25:04,461
‎The breaking of the alarm clock

194
00:25:04,544 --> 00:25:07,088
‎is no great matter,
‎so please do not trouble yourself over it.

195
00:25:09,132 --> 00:25:11,801
‎But the truth is,

196
00:25:11,885 --> 00:25:15,347
‎I cut my hand upon the broken clock.

197
00:25:16,348 --> 00:25:18,475
‎I had promised the elders of the house

198
00:25:18,558 --> 00:25:21,144
‎that I would study
‎the vernacular ‎Elementary Learning

199
00:25:21,728 --> 00:25:25,815
‎and copy out Introduction
‎to Confucian Learning a hundred times.

200
00:25:27,108 --> 00:25:30,278
‎It is my only regret
‎that I can no longer do so.

201
00:25:31,655 --> 00:25:33,531
‎As you well know,

202
00:25:34,241 --> 00:25:39,579
‎a promise is a matter of trust
‎between people, is it not?

203
00:25:39,663 --> 00:25:40,538
‎Elementary Learning‎…

204
00:25:41,414 --> 00:25:42,916
‎The vernacular ‎Elementary Learning‎?

205
00:25:43,667 --> 00:25:44,876
‎I suppose

206
00:25:46,002 --> 00:25:47,712
‎I shall now lose that trust, shan't I?

207
00:25:55,136 --> 00:25:55,971
‎62.

208
00:25:57,264 --> 00:25:58,098
‎63.

209
00:25:58,181 --> 00:26:00,183
‎I regret not bringing those to you sooner,

210
00:26:01,601 --> 00:26:05,146
‎but reading ‎Elementary Learning
‎after so long brought back many memories.

211
00:26:05,814 --> 00:26:06,856
‎65.

212
00:26:07,691 --> 00:26:11,361
‎-67, 68.
‎-I first learned it

213
00:26:11,444 --> 00:26:13,280
‎from my elder brother when I was 5.

214
00:26:13,363 --> 00:26:15,532
‎He was like a teacher to me.

215
00:26:15,615 --> 00:26:16,449
‎70.

216
00:26:17,033 --> 00:26:18,702
‎-71.
‎-Here's the truth.

217
00:26:18,785 --> 00:26:23,665
‎-He was 20 years and 7 months old…
‎-20. 27.

218
00:26:23,748 --> 00:26:26,042
‎-Maybe 8 months.
‎-28.

219
00:26:26,126 --> 00:26:28,795
‎-No, 6 months old when he…
‎-29, 30…

220
00:26:30,588 --> 00:26:31,423
‎30?

221
00:26:32,424 --> 00:26:33,633
‎For heaven's sake.

222
00:26:33,717 --> 00:26:36,594
‎Well, this year marks
‎the end of his three-year mourning.

223
00:26:36,678 --> 00:26:39,723
‎-Again. One.
‎-So I paid him a visit.

224
00:26:39,806 --> 00:26:40,640
‎Two.

225
00:26:41,141 --> 00:26:43,310
‎Every one of my steps toward him…

226
00:26:43,393 --> 00:26:45,645
‎-One.
‎-…was filled with grief.

227
00:26:45,729 --> 00:26:46,604
‎One?

228
00:26:47,105 --> 00:26:50,525
‎Darn it. Is he doing this on purpose?

229
00:26:51,109 --> 00:26:52,068
‎Elementary Learning

230
00:26:53,194 --> 00:26:55,447
‎is something that brings back
‎such tender memories

231
00:26:56,323 --> 00:26:57,282
‎of our time together--

232
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:01,703
‎Thank you for your efforts.

233
00:27:02,454 --> 00:27:04,998
‎But it seems one page is missing.

234
00:27:06,249 --> 00:27:07,625
‎There are only 99 here.

235
00:27:11,796 --> 00:27:14,090
‎That cannot be.
‎I distinctly copied a hundred.

236
00:27:14,716 --> 00:27:17,552
‎No, I counted them twice.

237
00:27:21,681 --> 00:27:24,351
‎You will bring me the last page too,

238
00:27:25,643 --> 00:27:26,478
‎won't you?

239
00:27:29,230 --> 00:27:30,065
‎Yes.

240
00:27:37,197 --> 00:27:38,073
‎Yes, miss.

241
00:27:39,407 --> 00:27:41,284
‎I shall certainly bring it.

242
00:28:36,047 --> 00:28:36,881
‎Well,

243
00:28:37,507 --> 00:28:38,341
‎here.

244
00:28:47,892 --> 00:28:50,019
‎Thank you, Young Master In-ho.

245
00:28:51,730 --> 00:28:52,605
‎Of course.

246
00:28:56,484 --> 00:29:00,155
‎May I ask your name?

247
00:29:04,659 --> 00:29:05,493
‎I am

248
00:29:06,703 --> 00:29:07,746
‎So-ok.

249
00:29:08,496 --> 00:29:09,873
‎My name is So-ok.

250
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:12,834
‎"So-ok."

251
00:29:14,544 --> 00:29:16,921
‎It suits you very well.

252
00:29:18,423 --> 00:29:19,507
‎"So-ok."

253
00:29:20,759 --> 00:29:22,093
‎Miss So-ok,

254
00:29:22,177 --> 00:29:25,138
‎what brings you to Lord Yoo's household?

255
00:29:25,221 --> 00:29:26,097
‎Me?

256
00:29:26,181 --> 00:29:30,351
‎Oh, well, I…

257
00:29:30,435 --> 00:29:33,062
‎Are you, by any chance, Lady Cho's niece

258
00:29:33,146 --> 00:29:35,064
‎who visited seven years ago?

259
00:29:36,316 --> 00:29:38,026
‎I recall my mother speaking of her.

260
00:29:40,111 --> 00:29:43,990
‎Then you must also be related
‎to Master Cho Won.

261
00:29:45,283 --> 00:29:47,202
‎Well, I…

262
00:29:49,412 --> 00:29:51,873
‎I should be going now.

263
00:29:52,832 --> 00:29:54,000
‎Wait.

264
00:29:59,714 --> 00:30:02,717
‎Well, that was rash of me.

265
00:30:09,933 --> 00:30:12,310
‎I brought this from my mother's quarters
‎without her knowing.

266
00:30:13,061 --> 00:30:15,271
‎You said you cut your hand.

267
00:30:17,982 --> 00:30:18,942
‎If you

268
00:30:19,651 --> 00:30:22,320
‎take a bit and dab it onto the wound,

269
00:30:22,946 --> 00:30:24,656
‎it should heal quickly.

270
00:30:26,199 --> 00:30:27,700
‎Since you were hurt because of me,

271
00:30:28,535 --> 00:30:30,453
‎I should take responsibility, shouldn't I?

272
00:30:40,839 --> 00:30:41,881
‎Three…

273
00:30:41,965 --> 00:30:44,843
‎No, two. I shall borrow it for two days.

274
00:30:46,386 --> 00:30:47,971
‎Two days from now, at this hour,

275
00:30:48,054 --> 00:30:52,016
‎when the two hands of the clock
‎stretch straight across,

276
00:30:53,476 --> 00:30:54,978
‎let us meet here again.

277
00:30:59,065 --> 00:31:00,024
‎Yes.

278
00:31:00,108 --> 00:31:00,942
‎Well then.

279
00:31:15,748 --> 00:31:16,749
‎Mind your step.

280
00:31:27,969 --> 00:31:29,304
‎When the two clocks… No.

281
00:31:29,387 --> 00:31:31,347
‎When the two hands
‎stretch straight across.

282
00:32:15,141 --> 00:32:17,018
‎Let me think.

283
00:32:18,436 --> 00:32:22,649
‎How long has it been
‎since we last shared a drink?

284
00:32:23,650 --> 00:32:28,029
‎The last time was
‎when I visited Hwaseong, was it not?

285
00:32:28,112 --> 00:32:30,073
‎Yes, you came

286
00:32:31,574 --> 00:32:33,618
‎for the relocation of Hyollyungwon.

287
00:32:37,997 --> 00:32:40,625
‎You see,

288
00:32:41,334 --> 00:32:44,545
‎I simply cannot understand.

289
00:32:44,629 --> 00:32:45,964
‎What do you mean?

290
00:32:46,047 --> 00:32:48,341
‎The heart of a father…

291
00:32:51,260 --> 00:32:53,012
‎who locked away

292
00:32:53,096 --> 00:32:56,307
‎the son he cherished so dearly
‎in a rice chest.

293
00:32:57,183 --> 00:32:59,268
‎How could he do such a thing
‎to his precious child?

294
00:33:00,603 --> 00:33:01,854
‎But you see.

295
00:33:01,938 --> 00:33:03,064
‎Yes?

296
00:33:03,147 --> 00:33:07,193
‎The son defied his father
‎until he was shut inside that rice chest.

297
00:33:10,530 --> 00:33:11,990
‎I believe I may understand him.

298
00:33:13,908 --> 00:33:15,118
‎To a son,

299
00:33:15,868 --> 00:33:18,997
‎his father may well be a world
‎with which he can never reconcile.

300
00:33:19,664 --> 00:33:20,915
‎Yes.

301
00:33:21,541 --> 00:33:23,543
‎Yes, indeed.

302
00:33:45,481 --> 00:33:46,941
‎I suppose the Crown Prince…

303
00:33:49,736 --> 00:33:50,820
‎and I…

304
00:33:55,908 --> 00:33:56,868
‎are both…

305
00:34:01,330 --> 00:34:03,791
‎but men defeated
‎before the name of "father."

306
00:34:27,648 --> 00:34:28,941
‎Make it light and clear.

307
00:34:29,734 --> 00:34:31,778
‎My cousin prefers it that way.

308
00:34:31,861 --> 00:34:32,987
‎Yes, madam.

309
00:35:00,723 --> 00:35:03,101
‎If I go on soaking myself in drink
‎like this again,

310
00:35:03,726 --> 00:35:06,062
‎I swear I'll change my name
‎from Yoo to Cho.

311
00:35:07,230 --> 00:35:10,358
‎Your jest goes too far, Minister Cho.

312
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,569
‎My head is splitting.

313
00:35:13,653 --> 00:35:15,446
‎I wish you had stopped me.

314
00:35:16,531 --> 00:35:18,032
‎My lord!

315
00:35:18,616 --> 00:35:19,534
‎My lord!

316
00:35:19,617 --> 00:35:20,952
‎From the palace…

317
00:35:21,035 --> 00:35:22,620
‎Someone has come from the palace.

318
00:35:22,703 --> 00:35:24,872
‎Did you say the palace?

319
00:35:24,956 --> 00:35:25,873
‎Yes.

320
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:30,169
‎I thought His Majesty had taken offense
‎and meant to dismiss me from office.

321
00:35:30,253 --> 00:35:32,171
‎Have I not always told you not to worry?

322
00:35:32,255 --> 00:35:34,757
‎None of it was ever your intention.

323
00:35:34,841 --> 00:35:38,511
‎I knew His Majesty
‎would surely know your true heart.

324
00:35:39,554 --> 00:35:40,721
‎You think so?

325
00:35:43,558 --> 00:35:46,060
‎-Quickly now. He has arrived.
‎-Right.

326
00:35:46,644 --> 00:35:48,604
‎Right, this is no time for this.

327
00:35:48,688 --> 00:35:50,898
‎I must hurry.

328
00:35:56,696 --> 00:35:59,407
‎I am ready. Go on, read it.

329
00:36:00,867 --> 00:36:02,952
‎-No, it is not--
‎-What are you waiting for?

330
00:36:03,035 --> 00:36:05,955
‎His Majesty calls for me.
‎We must not waste a moment.

331
00:36:06,539 --> 00:36:07,832
‎No, that is not it!

332
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:10,668
‎His Majesty

333
00:36:11,502 --> 00:36:13,754
‎seeks one named Cho Won.

334
00:36:19,385 --> 00:36:21,679
‎So it is not me?

335
00:36:22,805 --> 00:36:24,098
‎Cho Won, step forward.

336
00:36:33,441 --> 00:36:35,443
‎His Majesty ordered
‎that you read it yourself.

337
00:37:08,893 --> 00:37:10,978
‎Wait just a moment!

338
00:37:13,940 --> 00:37:15,233
‎Pour every last bit in.

339
00:37:19,779 --> 00:37:21,530
‎Bring that over here!

340
00:37:21,614 --> 00:37:22,823
‎Move it!

341
00:37:22,907 --> 00:37:26,285
‎We shall use five more ‎mal‎ of paste,
‎so keep that in mind.

342
00:37:28,287 --> 00:37:29,247
‎Who might you be?

343
00:37:30,373 --> 00:37:31,624
‎Who might you be?

344
00:37:31,707 --> 00:37:34,669
‎It seems I have found the right place.

345
00:38:04,573 --> 00:38:06,409
‎Take it easy!

346
00:38:07,285 --> 00:38:10,705
‎Even if we work through the night,
‎can we really sell any of this?

347
00:38:10,788 --> 00:38:12,415
‎Enough of your nonsense.

348
00:38:14,792 --> 00:38:17,086
‎So what brings you here?

349
00:38:20,047 --> 00:38:21,173
‎I heard that

350
00:38:22,174 --> 00:38:24,093
‎you were starving before.

351
00:38:24,176 --> 00:38:26,721
‎Have things improved at all since then?

352
00:38:26,804 --> 00:38:27,888
‎What do you think?

353
00:38:29,181 --> 00:38:30,808
‎Quite a few officials

354
00:38:31,475 --> 00:38:33,477
‎have caught hell because of you.

355
00:38:34,312 --> 00:38:36,897
‎I feared
‎there might have been retaliation,

356
00:38:36,981 --> 00:38:38,816
‎so I came to see for myself.

357
00:38:48,659 --> 00:38:50,369
‎So you met with him?

358
00:38:50,453 --> 00:38:52,621
‎I received your secret letter.

359
00:38:53,581 --> 00:38:56,709
‎And so, I have already ordered

360
00:38:57,209 --> 00:38:59,420
‎that all those involved
‎be summoned to Hanyang at once.

361
00:38:59,503 --> 00:39:01,130
‎My apologies, Your Majesty.

362
00:39:01,213 --> 00:39:04,008
‎It seems the matter concerns
‎more than that fellow Gil-san alone.

363
00:39:06,052 --> 00:39:07,094
‎I had assumed as much.

364
00:39:08,137 --> 00:39:11,766
‎Corruption spreads
‎like wildfire by its very nature.

365
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:15,394
‎My apologies, Your Majesty.

366
00:39:15,478 --> 00:39:17,688
‎You have nothing to apologize for.

367
00:39:20,483 --> 00:39:21,525
‎Left State Councilor.

368
00:39:21,609 --> 00:39:22,568
‎Yes, Your Majesty.

369
00:39:26,155 --> 00:39:28,699
‎I shall entrust him with a task.

370
00:39:30,493 --> 00:39:31,827
‎Please give your command.

371
00:39:34,580 --> 00:39:36,957
‎I confide this in you because I trust you.

372
00:39:37,541 --> 00:39:39,502
‎All that I have undertaken in Hwaseong

373
00:39:40,211 --> 00:39:44,799
‎may well be said to be driven by
‎my filial devotion to my late father.

374
00:39:45,383 --> 00:39:46,384
‎For that reason,

375
00:39:47,259 --> 00:39:48,552
‎I cannot allow

376
00:39:48,636 --> 00:39:51,472
‎even the slightest corruption
‎in matters concerning it.

377
00:40:02,191 --> 00:40:03,192
‎My lord.

378
00:40:04,193 --> 00:40:06,821
‎What brings you back to tobacco again?

379
00:40:10,199 --> 00:40:11,075
‎This is

380
00:40:12,493 --> 00:40:14,870
‎a book written by that Cho Won, is it not?

381
00:40:18,124 --> 00:40:18,999
‎The other day,

382
00:40:20,251 --> 00:40:22,628
‎I crossed paths with him in the street.

383
00:40:23,212 --> 00:40:26,924
‎He wore such an unsettling smile,
‎as if he were lusting after women.

384
00:40:27,550 --> 00:40:29,218
‎It did not sit well with me.

385
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:30,970
‎Did you not say

386
00:40:32,012 --> 00:40:35,307
‎he had fallen out
‎of the King's favor as well?

387
00:40:40,563 --> 00:40:41,397
‎I believe

388
00:40:43,399 --> 00:40:45,276
‎he may soon prove quite useful.

389
00:40:45,860 --> 00:40:47,862
‎You should know that I have told him

390
00:40:48,863 --> 00:40:50,739
‎to stay at our house for a while.

391
00:41:01,375 --> 00:41:02,626
‎This is all we need to pack?

392
00:41:03,752 --> 00:41:04,587
‎You rascal.

393
00:41:05,337 --> 00:41:08,215
‎Why do you look so pleased?
‎It is only nearby, so enough already.

394
00:41:09,967 --> 00:41:11,343
‎Are you leaving now?

395
00:41:11,927 --> 00:41:12,761
‎Goodness.

396
00:41:13,554 --> 00:41:16,390
‎Are you here to see me off?

397
00:41:17,725 --> 00:41:19,268
‎I am most honored.

398
00:41:19,351 --> 00:41:21,061
‎I must say, I am quite impressed.

399
00:41:21,562 --> 00:41:23,647
‎You somehow managed
‎to get into that household.

400
00:41:24,482 --> 00:41:26,108
‎Heaven must be helping me.

401
00:41:27,359 --> 00:41:28,319
‎Though I wonder

402
00:41:28,903 --> 00:41:30,070
‎who it's truly helping.

403
00:41:31,030 --> 00:41:32,448
‎Does this heavenly fortune

404
00:41:33,032 --> 00:41:34,825
‎favor you, my dear cousin,

405
00:41:35,993 --> 00:41:37,328
‎or me?

406
00:41:39,788 --> 00:41:41,499
‎To be blessed with heaven's favor,

407
00:41:41,582 --> 00:41:44,502
‎you have lived far too debauched a life,
‎have you not?

408
00:41:46,212 --> 00:41:47,546
‎Debauched, you say.

409
00:41:48,797 --> 00:41:51,467
‎Wait till our wager is over,

410
00:41:52,301 --> 00:41:53,802
‎then see for yourself.

411
00:41:54,803 --> 00:41:55,638
‎Cousin.

412
00:41:56,722 --> 00:41:58,349
‎I shall be going now.

413
00:42:12,154 --> 00:42:15,157
‎Madam, a messenger just dropped this off.

414
00:42:15,241 --> 00:42:16,825
‎It came from the Tobacco Shop,

415
00:42:16,909 --> 00:42:19,203
‎and it is addressed to Lord Cho Won.

416
00:42:19,286 --> 00:42:20,621
‎Shall I take it to him?

417
00:42:23,165 --> 00:42:25,000
‎Since it came from the Tobacco Shop,

418
00:42:25,084 --> 00:42:26,710
‎I assume it is tobacco.

419
00:42:28,671 --> 00:42:31,465
‎Yet that scarlet silk troubles me greatly.

420
00:42:32,299 --> 00:42:34,927
‎I shall deliver it myself,
‎so leave it in the inner quarters.

421
00:42:35,427 --> 00:42:36,262
‎Yes, madam.

422
00:42:52,027 --> 00:42:53,696
‎I have long awaited your arrival.

423
00:42:54,863 --> 00:42:55,739
‎This way, please.

424
00:43:02,538 --> 00:43:04,331
‎This is the rear garden of our house.

425
00:43:05,165 --> 00:43:07,001
‎Now that you have set foot
‎in this household,

426
00:43:07,084 --> 00:43:09,169
‎you must put aside any thought of fleeing.

427
00:43:09,837 --> 00:43:14,383
‎There is so much I wish to ask,
‎hear, and learn from you, sir.

428
00:43:19,680 --> 00:43:20,723
‎Oh, my.

429
00:43:22,391 --> 00:43:25,894
‎Over there
‎are my sister-in-law's quarters.

430
00:43:25,978 --> 00:43:27,730
‎As you must have seen,

431
00:43:27,813 --> 00:43:31,442
‎she is still in mourning
‎for my late brother.

432
00:43:32,610 --> 00:43:33,819
‎Is that so?

433
00:43:34,945 --> 00:43:36,405
‎Yes. This way, please.

434
00:47:50,951 --> 00:47:54,913
‎Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
